flowchart TD
  C[Desktop / mobile client<br/>watcher · chunker · local DB] -- 1. which chunks are new? --> API[Metadata API]
  API --> MDB[(Metadata DB<br/>files · versions · journal)]
  C -- 2. upload missing chunks<br/>presigned URLs --> OBJ[(Object storage<br/>chunks by SHA-256)]
  C -- 3. commit version<br/>base version check --> API
  API -- 4. change event --> NS[Notification service<br/>long-poll / WebSocket]
  NS -- 5. something changed --> C2[Other devices]
  C2 -- 6. changes after cursor --> API
  C2 -- 7. download missing chunks --> OBJ
